Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: remove objects from evict list after pinning them

Once objects are pinned they should not be kept in the evict list as that
will cause drm_gpuvm_validate to keep iterating a growing list of objects
needlessly.

Once an object is pinned remove it from the list.

Fixes: 2e6a8a1fe2b2 ("drm/msm: Add VM_BIND ioctl")

BACKPORT from the freedreno list, "[PATCH v2] drm/msm: remove objects from
evit list after pinning them", Anna Maniscalco, 2026-07-23:
https://www.mail-archive.com/freedreno@lists.freedesktop.org/msg46465.html
The Fixes: tag points at the VM_BIND ioctl, so this costs us on every
VM_BIND submit -- which is the path Turnip takes.

---

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gem_vma.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gem_vma.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gem_vma.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/msm_gem_vma.c
@@ -458,6 +458,8 @@
 			return ret;
 	}
 
+	drm_gpuvm_bo_evict(vm_bo, false);
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
